{"publicId":"3de81e3d-1d61-47c4-ba27-b0950a2aaa1e","title":"伯克希尔哈撒韦增持美国住房股Lennar并减持银行股","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T22:33:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T22:33:00.000Z","digest":"伯克希尔哈撒韦增持美国住房股Lennar并减持银行股，显示其加码美国住房市场。该公司在2026年第三季度将Lennar持股比例从12.8%增至25.1%，同时减持了富国银行等银行股，因认为当前经济环境下银行股估值过高【新】。这一调整延续了伯克希尔自2024年起对住房相关资产的持续投资，此前已通过收购美国联合住房公司（U.S. Homebuilding）扩大布局【新】。市场分析认为，此举可能反映伯克希尔对美联储降息周期的预期，但银行股减持幅度（约8%）小于住房股增持幅度（约97%），显示其风险偏好分化【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T23:29:52.212Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"伯克希尔哈撒韦增持美国住房股 Lennar 并减持银行股","latestReport":{"id":"w0yh35q6bso797az7uh4w64sh"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fZftoHqHFL9k","title":"Berkshire upped its bet on U.S. housing market","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T22:33:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"w0yh35q6bso797az7uh4w64sh","title":"伯克希尔哈撒韦增持美国住房股 Lennar 并减持银行股","summary":"伯克希尔哈撒韦在上一季度加大美国住房市场投资，几乎翻倍增持Lennar股份，并对部分银行股持负面态度。","source":{"name":"MarketWatch Top Stories","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:33:00.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"w0yh35q6bso797az7uh4w64sh","title":"伯克希尔哈撒韦增持美国住房股 Lennar 并减持银行股","summary":"伯克希尔哈撒韦在上一季度加大美国住房市场投资，几乎翻倍增持Lennar股份，并对部分银行股持负面态度。","source":{"name":"MarketWatch Top Stories","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:33:00.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T07:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"part